              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaka Culeman daŋ rik otio mel apipim i paco me Ejion-geber ame ceggi kede Elat i dog nam Arema, i lobo Edom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaka Kiram rik te cwayo jo mere ame gin odiro i nam, gin te wot tic i mel ame otio-nono kun otio karacel i jo a Culeman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gin rik te wot i melenogo naka i Opir ote wot kelo jabu i kuno, ame pekkere onwoŋo buco romo tan apar wie abic; romo poŋo lori adito me kare-ni adek gin te kelo jabu-nono luŋ baŋ abaka Culeman.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.28"
            ]
